---
import IntroBadge from "@/components/utils/IntroBadge.astro";
---

<section class="intro-block">
  <p>Hey there.</p>
  <p>
    I'm a developer who builds open source in my free time. These days I help
    maintain
    <IntroBadge name="npmx" />
    alongside
    <IntroBadge name="forges" />
    and
    <IntroBadge name="bombshell" />
    while contributing to
    <IntroBadge name="starlight" />
    and
    <IntroBadge name="changesets" />
    plus lots of other cool stuff.
  </p>
  <p>
    Outside of coding, I'm usually hanging out on the
    <IntroBadge name="bluesky" />
    platform. You can find my professional history over on my
    <IntroBadge name="sifa" />
    profile page.
  </p>
</section>

<style is:global>
  :root:not(.dark) .dark-only {
    display: none;
  }

  :root.dark .light-only {
    display: none;
  }
</style>

<style>
  .intro-block {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 64px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .intro-block strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
